content:
Help me define bounded contexts. Below I will provide domain information. 

#### Data:
These are the extracted objects and the subdomain grouping:
```json
{
  "domain objects": [
    {
      "name": "Platform Manager",
      "description": "person who oversees platform activity and adjusts overall policies"
    },
    {
      "name": "Platform Traffic",
      "description": "measure of user activity and engagement on the platform"
    },
    {
      "name": "Policy",
      "description": "platform rule or configuration set to influence user behavior"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sales Trends",
      "description": "data showing how items sell over time"
    },
    {
      "name": "Listing Specialist",
      "description": "person responsible for reviewing and improving product listings"
    },
    {
      "name": "Quality Review",
      "description": "evaluation process that checks whether a product listing meets standards"
    },
    {
      "name": "Product Listing",
      "description": "posted item with details for sale",
      "attributes": [
        "Item",
        "Photo",
        "Product Description",
        "Price Recommendation",
        "Availability",
        "Category"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Item",
      "description": "physical good being sold"
    },
    {
      "name": "Photo",
      "description": "image uploaded to represent an item"
    },
    {
      "name": "Product Description",
      "description": "text describing an item and its features"
    },
    {
      "name": "Price Recommendation",
      "description": "suggested price based on guidance or analysis"
    },
    {
      "name": "Availability",
      "description": "current sale status of an item"
    },
    {
      "name": "Category",
      "description": "classification that groups similar items"
    },
    {
      "name": "Customer Support Agent",
      "description": "person who resolves issues and answers support inquiries"
    },
    {
      "name": "Purchase Dispute",
      "description": "conflict between buyer and seller over a purchase"
    },
    {
      "name": "Support Inquiry",
      "description": "question or issue submitted to customer support"
    },
    {
      "name": "Seller",
      "description": "user who posts items for sale"
    },
    {
      "name": "Messaging",
      "description": "communication channel between users"
    },
    {
      "name": "Buyer",
      "description": "user who searches for and purchases items"
    },
    {
      "name": "Item Search",
      "description": "process or action where a buyer looks for listings",
      "attributes": [
        "Category"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Wishlist",
      "description": "collection of saved product listings a buyer likes",
      "attributes": [
        "Product Listing"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Purchase",
      "description": "completed transaction between buyer and seller"
    },
    {
      "name": "Feedback",
      "description": "buyer’s review after a purchase"
    }
  ]
}
```
```json
{
  "subdomains": {
    "Selling": {
      "objects": [
        "Seller",
        "Product Listing",
        "Item",
        "Photo",
        "Availability"
      ]
    },
    "Product Review": {
      "objects": [
        "Listing Specialist",
        "Product Listing",
        "Quality Review",
        "Product Description",
        "Price Recommendation",
        "Category"
      ]
    },
    "Purchasing": {
      "objects": [
        "Buyer",
        "Item Search",
        "Category",
        "Product Listing",
        "Wishlist",
        "Purchase",
        "Feedback"
      ]
    },
    "Platform Management": {
      "objects": [
        "Platform Manager",
        "Platform Traffic",
        "Policy",
        "Sales Trends"
      ]
    },
    "Exchange": {
      "objects": [
        "Customer Support Agent",
        "Purchase Dispute",
        "Support Inquiry",
        "Messaging"
      ]
    },
    "subdomain connections": [
      "Selling--Product Review",
      "Purchasing--Product Review",
      "Purchasing--Selling",
      "Purchasing--Platform Management",
      "Selling--Exchange",
      "Purchasing--Exchange"
    ]
  }
}
```

#### Task:
- Assign the subdomains to bounded contexts. 
- Name the subdomain the bounded context might be derived from, it might also be multiple.
- Identify cases, where an object does not have a unified meaning across all bounded contexts and suggest a name change.
- Return the bounded contexts in json format. Here is an example for structuring the data:
```json
{
  "bounded contexts": {
    "...": {
      "derived from": "...",
      "objects": [
        "...",
        "..."
      ],
      "name changes": []
    },
    "...": {
      "derived from": "...",
      "objects": [
        "...",
        "...",
        "..."
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "... -> ..."
      ]
    }
  }
}
```

Here are the bounded contexts: 
```json
{
  "bounded contexts": {
    "Selling": {
      "derived from": "Selling Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Seller",
        "Listing Submission",
        "Item",
        "Photo",
        "Availability"
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "Product Listing -> Listing Submission"
      ]
    },
    "Product Review": {
      "derived from": "Product Review Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Listing Specialist",
        "Product Entry",
        "Quality Review",
        "Product Description",
        "Price Recommendation",
        "Category"
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "Product Listing -> Product Entry"
      ]
    },
    "Purchasing": {
      "derived from": "Purchasing Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Buyer",
        "Item Search",
        "Search Category",
        "Product Listing",
        "Wishlist",
        "Purchase",
        "Feedback"
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "Category -> Search Category"
      ]
    },
    "Platform Management": {
      "derived from": "Platform Management Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Platform Manager",
        "Platform Traffic",
        "Policy",
        "Sales Trends"
      ],
      "name changes": []
    },
    "Exchange": {
      "derived from": "Exchange Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Customer Support Agent",
        "Purchase Dispute",
        "Support Inquiry",
        "Messaging"
      ],
      "name changes": []
    }
  }
}
```
